{"product_id":"the-ultimate-book-of-horse-and-rider","title":"The Ultimate Book Of Horse And Rider","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe authors have compiled what may be the most extensive and all-encompassing guide on the subject, perfect for both the horse owner and the equine enthusiast. Beginning appropriately with the history of the horse, this illustrated tome provides expert advice on choosing a horse, caring for your horse -- including stable management, grooming, exercise, and first aid -- step-by-step riding instructions, and a catalogue of saddlery and riding equipment for all levels of rider. This digest belongs in the permanent library of all horse fanciers.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 166 x 228\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Judith Draper | Debby Sly | Sarah Muir\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781843096917\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45862641074329,"sku":"17RE-1-9781843096917","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6903391e08e93_The_Ultimate_Book_Of_Horse_And_Rider_Judith_Draper___Debby_Sly___Sarah_Muir.jpg?v=1762366459","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-ultimate-book-of-horse-and-rider","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}